@org
; Current room buffer
;
; A copy of the current room's 256-byte definition (from $C000+256*room, copied
; by #R$88AE at room entry). The routines that draw and move things read the
; room from here. Format (offsets from $8000):
; .
; $00-$7F: layout, 512 cells (16 rows of 32), 2 bits per cell, 4 cells per
; byte with the first cell in bits 7-6. A cell value 0-3 selects tile 0-3
; below (#R$8D6B expands this into attributes).
; .
; $80-$9F: room name (32 ASCII characters, shown in the status line).
; .
; $A0-$D5: six tiles of 9 bytes: attribute, then 8 pixel rows. The tiles are
; (in this order) background, floor, wall, nasty, ramp, conveyor; only the
; first four can appear in the layout, ramp and conveyor are added from their
; fields. The routines compare attributes read from the attribute buffer
; with these tile attributes to find out what is where, so the attributes
; of the six tiles of one room should differ.
; .
; $D6: conveyor direction; $D7: conveyor address (word, in the $5E00
; attribute buffer); $D9: conveyor length in cells.
; .
; $DA: ramp direction (bit 0); $DB: ramp address (word, in the $5E00
; attribute buffer); $DD: ramp length in cells.
; .
; $DE: border colour. $DF-$E0: Unknown.
; .
; $E1-$E8: item graphic (8 bytes, one character cell).
; .
; $E9-$EC: room numbers to the left, right, up and down.
; .
; $ED-$EF: Unknown.
; .
; $F0-$FF: eight entity slots, 2 bytes each: definition index (bit 7
; Unknown, cleared before use), and one byte stored into the entity buffer
; (#R$8100). Entity definitions are at $A000, 8 bytes each.
@label=RoomBuffer
b$8000 DEFS $0080
@label=RoomName
 $8080 DEFS $0020
@label=RoomTiles
 $80A0 DEFS $09
@label=TileFloor
 $80A9 DEFS $09
@label=TileWall
 $80B2 DEFS $09
@label=TileNasty
 $80BB DEFS $09
@label=TileRamp
 $80C4 DEFS $09
@label=TileConveyor
 $80CD DEFS $09
@label=RoomConveyorDir
 $80D6 DEFS $01
@label=RoomConveyorAddr
 $80D7 DEFS $02
@label=RoomConveyorLen
 $80D9 DEFS $01
@label=RoomRampDir
 $80DA DEFS $01
@label=RoomRampAddr
 $80DB DEFS $02
@label=RoomRampLen
 $80DD DEFS $01
@label=RoomBorder
 $80DE DEFS $01
 $80DF DEFS $02
@label=RoomItemGfx
 $80E1 DEFS $08
@label=RoomExitLeft
 $80E9 DEFS $01
@label=RoomExitRight
 $80EA DEFS $01
@label=RoomExitUp
 $80EB DEFS $01
@label=RoomExitDown
 $80EC DEFS $01
 $80ED DEFS $03
@label=RoomEntitySlots
 $80F0 DEFS $10
